sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Operator as Screening Operator
    participant UI as React Frontend
    participant Server as Express API
    participant ONNX as ONNX Inference Engine
    participant DB as SQLite Database
    participant Worker as Python Evidence Worker

    Operator->>UI: Upload Fundus Scan + Input Demographics (Language: EN/HI)
    UI->>Server: POST /api/screening/upload (Multipart Image)
    Server->>DB: INSERT INTO screenings (status = 'UPLOADED')
    Server-->>UI: Return screeningId (e.g., DR-000022)

    UI->>Server: POST /api/screening/:id/process
    Server->>ONNX: Execute runInference(imageBuffer)
    ONNX->>ONNX: Sharp Resize (224x224 RGB, fit fill)
    ONNX->>ONNX: ImageNet Normalization & Softmax
    ONNX-->>Server: Return Prediction (Grade 0-4), Probabilities & Confidence
    Server->>DB: UPDATE screenings SET status='CLASSIFIED', result_grade, referable_dr

    Server-->>UI: Return Immediate Response (<80ms)\n(Grade, Confidence, Referable Flag)
    UI-->>Operator: Display Primary Classification Result Immediately

    Note over Server,Worker: Asynchronous Background Processing
    Server->>Worker: Enqueue JSON via Stdin (id, imagePath, predictedClass)
    Worker->>Worker: Generate Grad-CAM Heatmap Overlay
    Worker->>Worker: Execute IDRiD Lesion Segmentation (MA, HE, EX, SE %)
    Worker->>Worker: Execute DRIVE Vessel Segmentation Coverage %
    Worker-->>Server: Emit JSON via Stdout (status = 'OK', overlay PNG paths)

    Server->>DB: UPDATE screenings SET status='COMPLETED', gradcam_path, lesion_data, vessel_data
    UI->>Server: Poll GET /api/screening/:id/evidence-status
    Server-->>UI: Return status = 'READY' + Evidence PNG URLs
    UI-->>Operator: Render Interactive Grad-CAM Heatmap & Lesion Breakdown
